B.QD=new A.bv("bld_geothermal_bath",B.al,"Jeotermal Kapl\u0131ca (S\u0131cak P\u0131nar)","Geothermal Bath (Hot Spring)","Yeralt\u0131 magma s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 y\xfczeye \xe7\u0131kararak \xe7evresindeki 6 karoyu k\u0131\u015f\u0131n donmaktan korur.","Channels geothermal warmth, shielding 6 adjacent tiles from winter frost.","Jeotermal Kapl\u0131ca, Tundra karolar\u0131na in\u015fa edilir. Saniyede 0.20 termal enerji \xfcretir. En b\xfcy\xfck \xf6zelli\u011fi: 6 kom\u015fu karoya s\xfcrekli \u0131s\u0131 yayarak k\u0131\u015f\u0131n bu karolardaki binalar\u0131n asla donmamas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar (Odunsuz Is\u0131nma).","Yields 0.20 Warmth/sec and radiates passive heating to 6 adjacent hexes, preventing freezes.",B.RR,B.cr,"SV.35 | TUNDRA",B.a1G,B.D,B.D,B.ZI,B.W2,B.Zb)
