B.QY=new A.bv("seasons_celestial_omens",B.p8,"12 Hayvanl\u0131 G\xf6ksel Takvim & Kehanetler","12-Year Celestial Animal Calendar","Her yeni y\u0131lda g\xf6klerden inen 12 kadim hayvan ruhunun k\xfcresel l\xfctuflar\u0131.","Each game year bestows a global omen from the 12 celestial animal spirits.","Her 4 mevsim tamamland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda yeni bir G\xf6ksel Y\u0131l ba\u015flar:\n\n\u2022 Pars Y\u0131l\u0131: Ormanlar co\u015far, kereste \xfcretimi 2 kat\u0131na \xe7\u0131kar.\n\u2022 At Y\u0131l\u0131: Kervanlar ve i\u015f\xe7iler %50 daha h\u0131zl\u0131 hareket eder.\n\u2022 Ejder Y\u0131l\u0131: Madenler ve volkanik ocaklar zengin filiz d\xf6ker (1.8x Demir).\n\u2022 S\u0131\u011f\u0131r Y\u0131l\u0131: Zud ayaz\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 do\u011fal diren\xe7 ve ta\u015f bereketi.\n\u2022 Koyun Y\u0131l\u0131: S\xfcr\xfc bereketi, +%60 k\u0131m\u0131z ve et ia\u015fesi.\n\u2022 Tav\u015fan Y\u0131l\u0131: B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7 maliyetleri %25 ucuzlar.\n\u2022 S\u0131\xe7an Y\u0131l\u0131: Ambar stoklar\u0131 %50 geni\u015fler.\n\u2022 Y\u0131lan Y\u0131l\u0131: \u015eifac\u0131lar kadim iksirler \xfcretir, alt\u0131n takas\u0131 co\u015far.","Every completed year cycles through 12 celestial animal omens offering huge global multipliers like Tiger (2x wood), Horse (+50% worker speed), and Dragon (1.8x iron).",B.Rq,B.a3,"12 YIL D\xd6NG\xdcS\xdc",B.a11,B.D,B.D,B.ZZ,B.Uc,B.Wu)
